BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Creating With Purpose - Art By Faati LLC: Paint\, Sip &amp\; Speak
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261016T184500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261016T220000
UID:e56daaf79826eabca839997e160674c1@njpoetryevents.com
DESCRIPTION:Overview Join us for Paint Sip &amp\; Speak – share your sto
 ries\, sip some drinks\, and connect in a chill\, real-talk vibe! Paint\, 
 Sip &amp\; Speak Join us in person for Paint Sip &amp\; Speak\, a chill ev
 ent where you can sip your favorite drinkPaint\, Sip &amp\; Speak An eveni
 ng of art\, music\, creativity\, and self-expression. 🎨🎶 Join us for
  Paint\, Sip &amp\; Speak\, a unique creative experience where art meets l
 ive entertainment and community. Come ready to paint\, relax\, enjoy live 
 music and performances\, and connect with others in a fun and welcoming at
 mosphere. Whether you're an experienced artist or picking up a paintbrush 
 for the first time\, this event is all about creating\, connecting\, and e
 xpressing yourself. What to Expect 🎨 Painting Experience – Create you
 r own artwork and enjoy a guided\, creative atmosphere. 🎶 Live Music 
 – Enjoy music throughout the evening while you paint and socialize. 🎤
  Live Performances – Experience talented performers sharing their gifts 
 with the room. 🥂 Light Refreshments – Enjoy light refreshments while 
 you create and connect. Date: October 16\, 2026 Time: 7:00 PM – 10:00 PM
  - Doors open at 6:45 pm 📍 Location: The Cry Out Cave at Krueger Scott 
 Mansion\, Newark\, NJ - Side entrance: "Cry Out Cave" Sign. Please email a
 rtbyfaati@gmail.com for any questions Attire: Come dressed comfortably\, b
 ring your creativity\, and be ready for an evening filled with art\, expre
 ssion\, music\, and good energy. Doors Open at 6:45 pm Please arrive 15 mi
 nutes early to reserve your preferred seating. Space is limited\, so reser
 ve your spot and come Paint\, Sip &amp\; Speak with us! ✨ and openly cha
 t about all things paint. It's the perfect spot to share stories\, swap ti
 ps\, and connect with others who get it. No pressure\, just honest convos 
 and good vibes. Come as you are\, and let's talk paint over a sip! THEME: 
 An evening of art\, music\, creativity\, and self-expression. HOST: FAATII
  FEATURES: EUPHONY / DAI DAI / KHALIL JIBRAN / Q / LAURAYNE PRICE: $25 - $
 49.87 - https://www.eventbrite.com/e/paint-sip-speak--tickets-199826227626
 0 CONTACT: Please email artbyfaati@gmail.com for any questions / @cryoutca
 ve https://linktr.ee/cryoutnj
LOCATION:CRYOUT CAVE\, 601 MARTIN LUTHER KING BLVD\, NEWARK NJ 07102\, New
 ark\, NJ
URL:https://www.njpoetryevents.com/calendar/paint-sip-speak
X-SOURCE:NJ Poetry Events
