 ith us too. We love birthdays at Let It Flow! Friday\, October 16th and ev
 ery 3rd Friday of the month $10 advance | $15 at the door Performers: $5 a
 dvance | $10 at the door Want to perform? Text or call 862.306.1758 . Good
