BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:OUTCRY THE SLAM
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261017T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261017T210000
UID:f942cb758aedd4ed31b8f2894710b851@njpoetryevents.com
DESCRIPTION:@keynote__ LET SEASON 2 COMMENCE!!! Our ONE-YEAR ANNIVERSARY S
 HOW was absolutely AMAZINGGGG! The poets showed out\, the room was packed 
 with energy\, and y’all reminded us exactly why we do this. Now we’re 
