 r you’re just getting started\, come hang out with other writers and bui
 ld something together. Location: Philip Roth Personal Library\, Newark Pub
 lic Library Time: 6:00–7:30 PM Dates: Sept. 30\, Oct. 7\, Oct. 21\, Oct.
  28\, Nov. 18\, Dec. 2 &amp\; Dec. 16 Come through and bring something you
 ’re working on\, a notebook\, or just yourself! THEME: WRITING CLUB HOST
